# s129-braked.pad — S129: both brakes held on the rail while the train comes, from s129-train.toml's
# braked state (saved with the same brakes held). Quarter speed: 4000 ms a game second.
#
#   ./kit record watch/s129-train.toml --state 9 --pad watch/pads/s129-braked.pad -n 360
down square
down r2
sleep 60000
release
